      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A SERIES OF STAKES SET IN THE GROUND AT REGULAR INTERVALS\nTO FORM A RECTANGLE / TWINE STRUNG FROM STAKE TO STAKE TO DEMARK A\nGRID / A RECTANGLE REMOVED FROM THIS RECTANGLE",
      "links": []
